{
  "comment": "Gateway error responses -> the error an SDK raises (type, status, code), and how many requests it made. Types are language-neutral: auth, plan, concurrency_limit, no_capacity, not_stopped, gateway; each adapter maps its own classes. The mapping dispatches on the body `code` first, status second (PROTOCOL.md section 4).",
  "errors": [
